{title: Chal Chalen Apne Ghar}
{artist: James Wo Lamhe}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E] [B] [A] [E],        Chal cha [E] le apne ghar
Aye [A] mere humsa [E] far,        Band [E] darwaaje [A] kar
sabse ho be [E] khabar,        Pyar [E] dono kare
raat [A] bhar toot [E] kar,        Chal [E] chale apne [A] ghar
hum [E] safar,        [E] [B] [A] [E]
Na [E] jahan bheed ho,        Na [A] jahan bhar ke [E] log
Na [E] sheher mein [A] base,        laakhoon logo ka [E] shor
Chand [E] lamhe,        [B] tu inse [A] mujhe dur [E] kar
Chal [E] chale apne [A] ghar,        hum [E] safar
Duri [E] yan ye [A] mita,        jo bhi [F#m] hai darmi [B] yan
Aaj [E] kuch aise [A] mil,        ek [F#m] ho jaye [B] jaan
bhar [E] mujhe baahon,        [A] mein le [E] dooba chah [A] mein
pyar [E] kar tu bepananah,        katham be [E] chain rato
ke [A] ho silsi [E] lay,        Yun [E] laga le [A] mujhe
aaj apne [E] gale,        Kholo [E] har bandi [B] shen
Aaj [A] mujhme mein [E] utar,        Chal [E] chale apne [A] ghar
hum [E] safar
